{"ticker":"NVDA","updated":"2026-10-23T23:24:11Z","profile":{"longName":"NVIDIA Corporation","shortName":"NVIDIA Corporation","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","country":"United States","website":"https://www.nvidia.com","fullTimeEmployees":42000,"marketCap":5094050889728,"trailingPE":26.67004,"forwardPE":13.255753,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":16.813713,"pegRatio":0.27,"targetMeanPrice":328.95346,"targetHighPrice":515.0,"targetLowPrice":180.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":58,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":1.059,"earningsGrowth":1.278,"grossMargins":0.74674004,"operatingMargins":0.66236997,"profitMargins":0.63663,"totalRevenue":302970011648,"beta":2.216,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":243.37,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":164.27,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.47},"summary":"NVIDIA Corporation operates as a data center scale AI infrastructure company in the United States, Taiwan, China, Hong Kong, Europe, and internationally. It operates through Compute & Networking, and Graphics segments. The Compute & Networking segment provides data center accelerated computing and networking platforms and artificial intelligence solutions and software, and automotive platforms and autonomous and electric vehicle solutions, including software. The Graphics segment offers GeForce GPUs for gaming and PCs; Quadro/NVIDIA RTX GPUs for enterprise workstation graphics. The company's products are used in gaming, professional visualization, data center, and automotive markets. It sells its products to original equipment manufacturers, original device manufacturers, system integrators and distributors, independent software vendors, cloud service providers, add-in board manufacturers, distributors, automotive manufacturers and tier-1 automotive suppliers, and other ecosystem participants. It has a collaboration with Cisco to develop Ultra-Dense Small Form Factor Pluggable (USFP), a high-density optical module pluggable transceiver. It has a collaboration with ChipAgents to develop Build-A-Chip-Bench, a benchmark for AI agents carrying chip design tasks and The Company has a strategic alliance with MediaTek to build the next generations of AI computing platforms. NVIDIA Cor","summary_zh":"NVIDIA Corporation 在美國、台灣、中國、香港、歐洲和國際上作為資料中心規模的人工智慧基礎設施公司運作。它透過計算和網路以及圖形部門運作。運算和網路部門提供資料中心加速運算和網路平台、人工智慧解決方案和軟體、汽車平台以及自動駕駛和電動車解決方案（包括軟體）。圖形部分提供用於遊戲和 PC 的 GeForce GPU；適用於企業工作站圖形的 Quadro/NVIDIA RTX GPU。該公司的產品用於遊戲、專業視覺化、資料中心和汽車市場。其產品銷售給原始設備製造商、原始設備製造商、系統整合商和分銷商、獨立軟體供應商、雲端服務供應商、附加板製造商、經銷商、汽車製造商和一級汽車供應商以及其他生態系統參與者。它與思科合作開發超密集小型可插拔 (USFP)，這是一種高密度光模組可插拔收發器。它與 ChipAgents 合作開發了 Build-A-Chip-Bench，這是執行晶片設計任務的人工智慧代理的基準，並且該公司與聯發科建立了戰略聯盟，以建立下一代人工智慧運算平台。 NVIDIA Cor","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"半導體","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":178.35,"h":181.91,"l":176.57,"c":179.81,"v":163012800},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":180.06,"h":182.39,"l":178.81,"c":181.77,"v":168688200},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":181.98,"h":182.49,"l":179.1,"c":181.6,"v":235518900},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":180.82,"h":184.47,"l":176.41,"c":180.17,"v":281787800},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":178.11,"h":178.15,"l":173.15,"c":174.18,"v":243257900},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":170.0,"h":172.38,"l":167.22,"c":170.78,"v":231164900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":171.06,"h":172.41,"l":168.88,"c":170.62,"v":164424900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":170.57,"h":171.86,"l":169.41,"c":171.66,"v":141670100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":168.03,"h":169.03,"l":164.07,"c":167.02,"v":224441400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":167.55,"h":170.96,"l":167.35,"c":168.31,"v":163769100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":169.09,"h":170.98,"l":166.74,"c":170.76,"v":157548400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":176.64,"h":179.29,"l":175.47,"c":177.33,"v":226852000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":179.68,"h":180.28,"l":176.48,"c":177.17,"v":151159300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":177.77,"h":178.6,"l":176.45,"c":177.82,"v":124911000},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":175.67,"h":178.85,"l":174.51,"c":177.75,"v":147061600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":177.0,"h":177.5,"l":174.38,"c":174.88,"v":140737800},{"t":"2025-09-17","o"