DRi1xNXF0dm11NTgyVnJMTUhUQi1TckUtNmNIS3Y5NVgyZmxhQVI3WUhDb0kwS01DRlhFMWk0MzlVWUNvMnVKY09nMkJBdkotZGtOWjNLU1gwb1ozb1pn?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"關鍵事實：NVIDIA 公司預測 2027 年將出現 3M GPU；維拉·魯賓 NVL72"},{"title":"'People are now recognizing Nvidia's compute has a great deal of residual value,' CEO Jensen Huang tells Deirdre Bosa","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"執行長黃仁勳 (Jensen Huang) 告訴迪爾德麗·博薩 (Deirdre Bosa)，“人們現在認識到 Nvidia 的計算具有巨大的剩餘價值”"},{"title":"Nvidia’s $1.1 Billion KYEC Deal Is the Small Number in a $279 Billion Supply Bet","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNTVkzTm9raWlWZUF5ZDNnbHViRkl2WUhobkZKbUJDYlppTVNhZWx3Rk9SNVhibHhXQ3EydDJTU2VMNXJYbnBMSFNTcFBNT1AtYW44bW5GaGRVRWF4Rjl3eWlhOWR0cUI0TDNpT3hsUGdXUDZxUXFSN0lxT0FyXzhqRDE4ckI2NHdpNml6ejA5a1hsZw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"Nvidia 11 億美元的 KYEC 交易只是 2,790 億美元供應賭注中的一小部分"}],"themes":[{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":8},{"name":"半導體/晶片","count":6},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":4},{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"自駕/機器人","count":1},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-25","period":"2026-01-25","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1045810/000104581026000021/nvda-20260125.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"NVIDIA pioneered accelerated computing to help solve the most challenging computational problems. NVIDIA is now a data center scale AI infrastructure company reshaping all industries.","zh":"NVIDIA 率先推出加速運算，協助解決最具挑戰性的運算問題。 NVIDIA 現在是一家資料中心規模的人工智慧基礎設施公司，正在重塑所有產業。"},{"en":"Our technology stack includes the foundational NVIDIA CUDA development platform that runs on all NVIDIA GPUs, as well as hundreds of domain-specific software libraries, frameworks, algorithms, software development kits, or SDKs, and application programming interfaces, or APIs. This deep and broad software stack accelerates the performance and facilitates the deployment of NVIDIA accelerated computing for computationally intensive workloads such as artificial intelligence, or AI, model training and inference, data analytics, scientific computing, robotics, and 3D graphics, with vertical-specific optimizations to address industries ranging from healthcare and telecom to automotive and manufacturing.","zh":"我們的技術堆疊包括在所有 NVIDIA GPU 上運行的基礎 NVIDIA CUDA 開發平台，以及數百個特定領域的軟體庫、框架、演算法、軟體開發套件或 SDK 以及應用程式介面或 API。這種深入且廣泛的軟體堆疊可提高效能，並促進針對計算密集型工作負載（例如人工智慧、模型訓練和推理、數據分析、科學計算、機器人和 3D 圖形）部署 NVIDIA 加速計算，並透過針對醫療保健和電信、汽車和製造等行業的特定垂直優化來解決這些問題。"},{"en":"Introduced with the Blackwell architecture, our data-center-scale offerings feature extreme co-design where the infrastructure's chips, networking, systems, software, and algorithms are holistically architected and optimized to maximize performance and scale. Hundreds of thousands of GPUs can be interconnected to function as a single giant computer. This type of data center architecture and scale is needed for the development and deployment of modern AI and accelerated computing applications.","zh":"我們的資料中心規模產品採用 Blackwell 架構推出，具有極端的協同設計，其中基礎設施的晶片、網路、系統、軟體和演算法經過整體架​​構和最佳化，以最大限度地提高效能和規模。數十萬個 GPU 可以互連起來，充當一台巨型電腦。現代人工智慧和加速運算應用的開發和部署需要這種類型的資料中心架構和規模。"}],"markets":[{"en":"The Compute & Networking segment includes our Data Center accelerated computing and networking platforms and AI solutions and software, and Automotive platforms and autonomous and electric vehicle solutions including software.","zh":"運算和網路部門包括我們的資料中心加速運算和網路平台以及人工智慧解決方案和軟體，以及汽車平台和自動駕駛和電動車解決方案（包括軟體）。"},{"en":"The Graphics segment includes GeForce GPUs for gaming and PCs, and Quadro/NVIDIA RTX GPUs for enterprise workstation graphics.","zh":"圖形部分包括用於遊戲和 PC 的 GeForce GPU，以及用於企業工作站圖形的 Quadro/NVIDIA RTX GPU。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Our worldwide sales and marketing strategy is key to achieving our objective of providing markets with our high-performance and efficient computing platforms and software. Our sales and marketing teams, located across our global markets, work closely with customers and various industry ecosystems through our partner network. Our partner network incorporates global, regional and specialized CSPs, OEMs, ODMs, ISVs, global system integrators, add-in board manufacturers, or AIBs, distributors, automotive manufacturers and tier-1 automotive suppliers, and other ecosystem participants.","zh":"我們的全球銷售和行銷策略是實現我們為市場提供高效能、高效運算平台和軟體的目標的關鍵。我們的銷售和行銷團隊遍佈全球市場，透過我們的合作夥伴網路與客戶和各行業生態系統密切合作。我們的合作夥伴網路包括全球、區域和專業 CSP、OEM、ODM、ISV、全球系統整合商、附加板製造商或 AIB、經銷商、汽車製造商和一級汽車供應商以及其他生態系統參與者。"},{"en":"Members of our sales team have technical expertise and product and industry knowledge. We also employ a team of application engineers and solution architects to provide pre-sales assistance to our partner network in designing, testing, and qualifying system designs that incorporate our platforms. For example, our solution architects work with CSPs to provide pre-sales assistance to enable our customers to optimize their hardware and software infrastructure for generative and agentic AI and LLM training and deployment. They also work with foundation model and enterprise software developers to enable our customers to optimize the training and fine-tuning of their models and services, and with enterprise end-users, often in collaboration with their global system integrator of choice, to fine-tune models and build AI applications. We believe that the depth and quality of our design support a","zh":"我們的銷售團隊成員擁有技術專業知識以及產品和行業知識。我們還聘請了一支由應用工程師和解決方案架構師組成的團隊，為我們的合作夥伴網路提供售前協助，幫助我們設計、測試和鑑定包含我們平台的系統設計。例如，我們的解決方案架構師與 CSP 合作提供售前協助，使我們的客戶能夠優化其硬體和軟體基礎設施，以進行生成式和代理式 AI 以及 LLM 培訓和部署。他們還與基礎模型和企業軟體開發人員合作，使我們的客戶能夠優化其模型和服務的培訓和微調，並與企業最終用戶合作，通常與其選擇的全球系統整合商合作，微調模型並建立人工智慧應用程式。我們相信我們設計的深度和品質支持"}],"competition":[{"en":"The market for our products is intensely competitive and is characterized by rapid technological change and evolving industry standards. We believe that the principal competitive factors in this market are performance, breadth of product offerings, access to customers and partners and distribution channels, software support, conformity to industry standard APIs, manufacturing capabilities, processor pricing, and total system costs. We believe that our ability to remain competitive will depend on how well we are able to anticipate the features and functions that customers and partners will","zh":"我們產品的市場競爭激烈，技術變革迅速，產業標準不斷發展。我們認為，該市場的主要競爭因素是效能、產品供應的廣度、接觸客戶和合作夥伴以及分銷管道、軟體支援、符合行業標準 API、製造能力、處理器定價和總系統成本。我們相信，我們保持競爭力的能力將取決於我們能否很好地預測客戶和合作夥伴將要使用的特性和功能。"},{"en":"demand and whether we are able to deliver consistent volumes of our products at acceptable levels of quality and at competitive prices. We expect competition to increase from both existing competitors and new market entrants with products that may be lower priced than ours or may provide better performance or additional features not provided by our products. In addition, it is possible that new competitors or alliances among competitors could emerge and acquire significant market share.","zh":"需求以及我們是否能夠以可接受的品質水準和有競爭力的價格提供穩定數量的產品。我們預計現有競爭對手和新市場進入者的競爭將會加劇，他們的產品可能比我們的產品價格更低，或者可能提供更好的性能或我們產品未提供的附加功能。此外，新的競爭對手或競爭對手之間的聯盟可能會出現並獲得重要的市場份額。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-01-25","items":[{"name":"Compute & Networking","val":193479000000,"zh":"運算與網通"},{"name":"Graphics","val":22459000000,"zh":"繪圖"}],"total":215938000000},"prod":{"end":"2026-01-25","items":[{"name":"Data Center","val":193737000000,"zh":"資料中心"},{"name":"Compute","val":162361000000,"zh":"運算"},{"name":"Networking","val":31376000000,"zh":"網通"},{"name":"Gaming","val":16042000000,"zh":"遊戲"},{"name":"Professional Visualization","val":3191000000,"zh":"專業視覺化"},{"name":"Automotive","val":2349000000,"zh":"汽車"},{"name":"OEM & Other","val":619000000,"zh":"OEM 與其他"}],"total":215938000000},"geo":{"end":"2026-01-25","items":[{"name":"US","val":149617000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"TW","val":42345000000,"zh":"台灣"},{"name":"China Including Hong Kong","val":19677000000,"zh":"中國（含香港）"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":4299000000,"zh":"其他國家"}],"total":215938000000}},"peers":["TSLA","AMZN","AAPL","AMD","META"]}}